    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21886" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γένημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>produce</i>, of the fruits of the earth (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γέννημα</span>), <i><span class="en">
